<td id="S5.F8.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><img src="2209.03003v1/fig_cifar_step_123.png" id="S5.F8.g2" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:224/109;" width="224" height="109" alt="Refer to caption"></td></tr>
<tr id="S5.F8.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S5.F8.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="S5.F8.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">(a) FID and Recall vs. Number of Euler discretization steps <math id="S5.F8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math></span></td>
<td id="S5.F8.2.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="S5.F8.2.1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">(b) FID and Recall vs. Training Iterations</span></td></tr>
