</table>
</span></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 13: </span>
Samples of 1-rectified flow simulated with <math id="S5.F13.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=100" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=100</annotation></semantics></math> Euler steps between different domains.
</figcaption>
